Modifications (October 2026): the framework was reduced to a batch-only core.
All streaming, Kafka, Event Hubs, Auto Loader, CDC/SCD, append-flow, sink, snapshot,
CLI, app, MCP, demo and compatibility code was removed; the declarative-pipeline runtime
was replaced by a batch job runner; and COBOL ingestion through the Cobrix (spark-cobol)
library was added. Every source file under src/ has been modified or rewritten.
